<step1>
<ptxt>ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly (Built-in Skid Control Computer) Terminals</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The skid control computer is built into the actuator, and the actuator connector is a waterproof connector, so the voltage of each terminal cannot be inspected and oscilloscope waveforms cannot be checked with it installed on the vehicle.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Check the actuator operation and communication establishment using the data monitor and Active Test with the SST (TaSCAN). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000602011X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
