<step1>
<ptxt>Inspect ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly Wire Harness Side Connector</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector from the actuator assembly.</ptxt>
</step2>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage or resistance between each terminal of the wire harness side connector of the actuator assembly and body ground.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
